WEBVTT

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.743
from the atmosphere

00:03:30.767 --> 00:03:34.239
could offset two degrees Celsius
or more of warming.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:39.235
Now, I'm a technology executive,
not a scientist.

00:03:39.259 --> 00:03:42.068
About a decade ago,
concerned about climate,

00:03:42.092 --> 00:03:46.232
I started to talk with scientists about
potential countermeasures to warming.

00:03:46.987 --> 00:03:50.003
These conversations grew
into collaborations

00:03:50.027 --> 00:03:52.351
that became the Marine
Cloud Brightening Project,

00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:54.657
which I'll talk about momentarily,

00:03:54.681 --> 00:03:58.734
and the nonprofit policy organization
SilverLining, where I am today.

00:03:59.483 --> 00:04:03.070
